弄ってきそうやな "}],[{"text":"金賭けるよりどの馬が最強かのG1見るだけの方が健全だしおもろいわ "}],[{"text":"最近直前で倍率大きく変わるのなんとかしてほしい "},{"br":1},{"text":"あれはAI自動投票勢の影響やろ "},{"br":1},{"color":"#008000","text":"【10分で分かる競馬AI】"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://youtu.be/c6TDW7qUWGY","text":"https://youtu.be/c6TDW7qUWGY"},{"br":1},{"text":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/c6TDW7qUWGY","href":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/c6TDW7qUWGY"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FoUFJ3kzL._SL160_.jpg"},{"br":1},{"size":12,"href":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/exec/obidos/ASIN/B08HZ81YC4/worksw-22/","text":"AI競馬"},{"br":1},{"size":12,"href":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/exec/obidos/ASIN/B08HZ81YC4/worksw-22/","text":"人工知能は馬券を"},{"br":1},{"size":12,"href":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/exec/obidos/ASIN/B08HZ81YC4/worksw-22/","text":"制することが"},{"br":1},{"size":12,"href":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/exec/obidos/ASIN/B08HZ81YC4/worksw-22/","text":"できるか？ [PR]"},{"br":1},{"text":" はてなブックマークに追加"},{"br":1},{"href":"http://twitter.com/share?url=http://workingnews117.com/blog-entry-22606.html&text=%E3%80%90%E6%82%B2%E5%A0%B1%E3%80%91%E7%AB%B6%E9%A6%AC%E3%80%81AI%E3%81%AB%E8%8D%92%E3%82%89%E3%81%95%E3%82%8C%E3%81%A6%E9%80%9D%E3%81%8F","text":" twitterでつぶやく"},{"br":1},{"href":"http://workingnews117.com/blog-entry-22606.html?sp&m2=form","text":"コメントを書く"},{"br":1},{"href":"http://workingnews117.com/blog-entry-22606.html?sp&m2=res","text":"コメント(19)"},{"br":1},{"href":"http://workingnews117.com/blog-entry-22606.html?sp&m2=tb","text":"トラックバック(0)"},{"br":1},{"href":"http://workingnews117.com/blog-entry-22605.html?sp","text":"次の記事"}]],"comments":[]}